          <hr />
          <h2>💡 Takeaways</h2>
          <p>Even though most of the code was co-written with an AI, this project taught me how to <strong>steer a complex build, understand the moving parts, and make informed decisions about architecture, security, and design</strong>. It’s the kind of “vibe coding” that works well for rapid prototyping, and for creating something magical for my students.</p>
          <p>End result: I now have a fully functional, secure, space-themed classroom achievement tracker that my students are going to love, and a lot more confidence in tackling JavaScript and Node.js projects in the future.</p>
